Here's my own biased opinion: No.

About middle-game, you have expensive god-granted protection which
you'd lose. Also, being in good standing with your god is a valuable
asset. My own favourite way to get unholy water is to find it (95% of
games), or to #dip uncursed water into fountains when ready.

> About middle game I'm often wanting some cursed scrolls of genocide,
> or want to curse a scroll of destroy armour to get the rustproofing...

Cursed scrolls can also be obtained by writing with an uncursed marker
on cursed blank paper, or with a cursed marker on non-blessed blank
paper. Furthermore, it is often more straightforward to uncurse a
cursed scroll of enchant armor, or to directly use uncursed enchant
armor than to bother with uncursed destroy armor scrolls.

